NSCameraUsageDescription = "The S Team Sport requires access to your camera to allow you to customize your profile picture, making your experience more personal and recognizable within the community. Additionally, camera access is required to use the photo-taking feature when writing comments, allowing you to share relevant moments, evidence, or illustrations with other users. No other use of your camera is intended, and the photos taken are only stored locally on your device and/or on our Firebase servers as part of your user content.";
NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription = "The S Team Sport would like to access your photo library to provide you with the ability to select an existing photo as your profile picture, giving you more flexibility in customizing your account. This access is also required if you wish to attach photos from your gallery when writing comments, allowing you to share images you have already taken. We will not access any other photos in your photo library, and the selected images will only be used for your profile picture and comments within the app, stored locally on your device and/or on our Firebase servers as part of your user content.";
NSMicrophoneUsageDescription = "The S Team Sport requires access to your microphone to provide you with the ability to record voice comments in response to posts or other comments. This feature allows you to share your thoughts and reactions more quickly and expressively, enriching discussions within the community. Microphone access is only used when you voluntarily initiate the recording of a voice comment. No audio recording is made without your knowledge, and recordings are only stored locally on your device and/or on our Firebase servers as part of your User Content.";
